! run -- including "SLC,$" on line 17, "LC,8,S Q K($9)" and
! "BXCZ,K SUPP".  There is exactly ONE substitution on the page:
!
! >>> SUBSTITUTION, LABELLED LOUDLY: line 4 prints "SLC,$" and
